Create RouteKit.swift:
```swift
public struct RouteLabel {
    private let prefix: String
    let internalTag = "local"
    public init(prefix: String) {
        self.prefix = prefix
    }
    public func text(for place: String) -> String {
        return prefix + ":" + place
    }
}
```
RouteLabel stores a prefix and joins it to a place name. The type, initializer, and text method each need public so another module can use them. prefix stays private; internalTag stays inside the module.
